                &lt;p class="fp-label"&gt;HELP &amp;amp; ACCESSIBILITY&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;h1 class="fp-title"&gt;Make the website easier to use&lt;/h1&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-intro"&gt;These options support older users with different reading and technology needs. Try the text-size buttons below â€” the page changes immediately.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;section class="help-card help-text"&gt;
                    &lt;h2&gt;Text size&lt;/h2&gt;
                    &lt;p&gt;Choose the text size that is easiest for you to read.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;button class="help-control control-large" id="largerTextButton" type="button"&gt;A+ Larger&lt;/button&gt;
                    &lt;button class="help-control control-small" id="smallerTextButton" type="button"&gt;Aâˆ’ Smaller&lt;/button&gt;
                    &lt;button class="help-control control-reset" id="resetTextButton" type="button"&gt;Reset&lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;
                &lt;section class="help-card help-listen"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Listen&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The blue Listen button at the top of every page reads the main page content aloud using your browser.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
                &lt;section class="help-card help-phone"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Need help?&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Call &lt;strong&gt;1800 123 456&lt;/strong&gt; for support. The number also appears in the footer on every page.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
                &lt;section class="help-card help-nav"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Easy navigation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The same top bar appears on every page, and the Australian Silver Support logo always returns to Home.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
            &lt;/main&gt;
