<h3>passwords.html</h3><pre>
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
    &lt;head&gt;
        &lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
        &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
        &lt;title&gt;Passwords &amp; Two-Factor Authentication&lt;/title&gt;
        &lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="static/css/style.css"&gt;
    &lt;/head&gt;
    &lt;body&gt;
        &lt;div class="webpage"&gt;
            &lt;!-- navigation --&gt;
            &lt;nav class="navbar"&gt;
                &lt;a class="logo" href="main.html"&gt;&lt;img alt="Australian Silver Support" src="static/images/logo.png"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item home-link " href="main.html"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item learn-link active" href="learn.html"&gt;Learn&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item glossary-link " href="glossary.html"&gt;Glossary&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item game-link " href="escape-the-scam.html"&gt;Escape the Scam&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item about-link " href="about.html"&gt;About Us&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;button aria-label="Read the main page content aloud" class="listen-button" id="listenButton" type="button"&gt;ðŸ”Š Listen&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/nav&gt;
            &lt;main class="main figma-page interactive-lesson lesson-password" id="main"&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-label"&gt;LESSON 4 â€¢ READ â†’ 3 QUESTIONS â†’ ESCAPE THE SCAM&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;h1 class="fp-title"&gt;Passwords &amp; Two-Factor Authentication&lt;/h1&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-intro"&gt;Strong account protection uses a long unique password and, where possible, a second sign-in step.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-reading-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 1 â€” READ&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;h2&gt;Stronger account habits&lt;/h2&gt;
                    &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use a long unique password or passphrase.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not reuse important passwords.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Turn on two-factor authentication where possible.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never read one-time security codes to unexpected callers.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;div class="game-prep-note"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this matters:&lt;/strong&gt; these exact skills are used again in Escape the Scam.&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-quiz-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="quiz-panel-title"&gt;&lt;span class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 2 â€” CHECK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2&gt;3 Quick Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get instant feedback before you continue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="pass1"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;1. Which password habit is safer?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="pass1a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass1','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;Use the same short password everywhere.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="pass1b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass1','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;Use a long unique password or passphrase.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="pass1c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass1','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;Use your first name.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="pass1Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="pass2"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;2. What does two-factor authentication add?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="pass2a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass2','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;A second proof of identity.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="pass2b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass2','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;A shorter password.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="pass2c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass2','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;A public security code.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="pass2Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="pass3"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;3. What should you do with a one-time security code?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="pass3a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass3','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;Tell an unexpected caller who asks.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="pass3b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass3','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;Keep it private.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="pass3c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('pass3','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;Post it in a chat so you do not forget it.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="pass3Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;

                &lt;button class="lesson-complete quiz-complete" id="lessonCompleteButton" onclick="markLessonComplete('passwords')" type="button" disabled&gt;Mark lesson complete&lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;a class="lesson-next quiz-next" href="escape-the-scam.html"&gt;Play Escape the Scam&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;p class="complete-message quiz-complete-message" id="completeMessage"&gt;Answer all 3 questions to unlock this button.&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/main&gt;
            &lt;!-- footer --&gt;
            &lt;footer class="footer"&gt;
                &lt;a class="help-link" href="help.html"&gt;&lt;span class="footer-icon"&gt;â˜Ž&lt;/span&gt;Need help? call 1800 123 456&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;div class="footer-line"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;span class="support-message"&gt;We're here to support you&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span class="safe-message"&gt;&lt;span class="footer-icon"&gt;â™¥&lt;/span&gt;Stay safe, stay connected&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;/footer&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;script src="static/js/Tung.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
    &lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;

</pre>
<h3>safe-websites.html</h3><pre>
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
    &lt;head&gt;
        &lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
        &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
        &lt;title&gt;Checking Safe Websites&lt;/title&gt;
        &lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="static/css/style.css"&gt;
    &lt;/head&gt;
    &lt;body&gt;
        &lt;div class="webpage"&gt;
            &lt;!-- navigation --&gt;
            &lt;nav class="navbar"&gt;
                &lt;a class="logo" href="main.html"&gt;&lt;img alt="Australian Silver Support" src="static/images/logo.png"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item home-link " href="main.html"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item learn-link active" href="learn.html"&gt;Learn&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item glossary-link " href="glossary.html"&gt;Glossary&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item game-link " href="escape-the-scam.html"&gt;Escape the Scam&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item about-link " href="about.html"&gt;About Us&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;button aria-label="Read the main page content aloud" class="listen-button" id="listenButton" type="button"&gt;ðŸ”Š Listen&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/nav&gt;
            &lt;main class="main figma-page interactive-lesson lesson-web" id="main"&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-label"&gt;LESSON 2 â€¢ READ â†’ 3 QUESTIONS â†’ ESCAPE THE SCAM&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;h1 class="fp-title"&gt;Checking Safe Websites&lt;/h1&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-intro"&gt;A website can look professional and still be fake. Check the address before entering information.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-reading-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 1 â€” READ&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;h2&gt;What to check&lt;/h2&gt;
                    &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Read the full website address carefully.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Look for misspellings, extra words or unusual endings.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;HTTPS protects the connection, but does not prove the site is genuine.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use official apps, bookmarks or trusted links.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;div class="game-prep-note"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this matters:&lt;/strong&gt; these exact skills are used again in Escape the Scam.&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-quiz-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="quiz-panel-title"&gt;&lt;span class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 2 â€” CHECK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2&gt;3 Quick Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get instant feedback before you continue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="web1"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;1. Which website clue matters most?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="web1a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web1','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;A fancy design.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="web1b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web1','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;The correct full website address.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="web1c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web1','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;A large familiar logo.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="web1Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="web2"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;2. What does HTTPS tell you?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="web2a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web2','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;The connection is protected.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="web2b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web2','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;The website is definitely genuine.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="web2c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web2','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;The page can never be fake.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="web2Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="web3"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;3. What is safest for online banking?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="web3a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web3','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;A link from a random text.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="web3b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web3','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;The official app or a saved bookmark.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="web3c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('web3','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;The first advertisement you see.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="web3Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
