<h3>scam-emails.html</h3><pre>
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
    &lt;head&gt;
        &lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
        &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
        &lt;title&gt;Spotting Scam Emails&lt;/title&gt;
        &lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="static/css/style.css"&gt;
    &lt;/head&gt;
    &lt;body&gt;
        &lt;div class="webpage"&gt;
            &lt;!-- navigation --&gt;
            &lt;nav class="navbar"&gt;
                &lt;a class="logo" href="main.html"&gt;&lt;img alt="Australian Silver Support" src="static/images/logo.png"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item home-link " href="main.html"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item learn-link active" href="learn.html"&gt;Learn&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item glossary-link " href="glossary.html"&gt;Glossary&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item game-link " href="escape-the-scam.html"&gt;Escape the Scam&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item about-link " href="about.html"&gt;About Us&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;button aria-label="Read the main page content aloud" class="listen-button" id="listenButton" type="button"&gt;ðŸ”Š Listen&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/nav&gt;
            &lt;main class="main figma-page interactive-lesson lesson-email" id="main"&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-label"&gt;LESSON 1 â€¢ READ â†’ 3 QUESTIONS â†’ ESCAPE THE SCAM&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;h1 class="fp-title"&gt;Spotting Scam Emails&lt;/h1&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-intro"&gt;Scam emails can look convincing. Stop and check before you click.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-reading-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 1 â€” READ&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;h2&gt;Key tips to remember&lt;/h2&gt;
                    &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Urgency or fear is a common scam warning sign.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not trust unexpected links or attachments.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Never give passwords or security codes through an unexpected message.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Verify the sender using contact details you already trust.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;div class="game-prep-note"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this matters:&lt;/strong&gt; these exact skills are used again in Escape the Scam.&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-quiz-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="quiz-panel-title"&gt;&lt;span class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 2 â€” CHECK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2&gt;3 Quick Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get instant feedback before you continue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="email1"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;1. An email says your account closes in 20 minutes. What should you do?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="email1a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email1','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;Click the link immediately.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="email1b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email1','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;Open the official app or call a trusted number.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="email1c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email1','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;Reply with your password.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="email1Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="email2"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;2. Which is a scam warning sign?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="email2a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email2','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;An unexpected request for a security code.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="email2b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email2','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;A message you expected from a friend.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="email2c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email2','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;A saved bookmark you opened yourself.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="email2Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="email3"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;3. What is safest when a sender seems suspicious?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="email3a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email3','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;Trust the logo because it looks real.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="email3b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email3','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;Check the message using a trusted contact method.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="email3c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('email3','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;Send your details to prove who you are.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="email3Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;

                &lt;button class="lesson-complete quiz-complete" id="lessonCompleteButton" onclick="markLessonComplete('emails')" type="button" disabled&gt;Mark lesson complete&lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;a class="lesson-next quiz-next" href="safe-websites.html"&gt;Next: Safe Websites&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;p class="complete-message quiz-complete-message" id="completeMessage"&gt;Answer all 3 questions to unlock this button.&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/main&gt;
            &lt;!-- footer --&gt;
            &lt;footer class="footer"&gt;
                &lt;a class="help-link" href="help.html"&gt;&lt;span class="footer-icon"&gt;â˜Ž&lt;/span&gt;Need help? call 1800 123 456&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;div class="footer-line"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;span class="support-message"&gt;We're here to support you&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span class="safe-message"&gt;&lt;span class="footer-icon"&gt;â™¥&lt;/span&gt;Stay safe, stay connected&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;/footer&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;script src="static/js/Tung.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
    &lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;

</pre>
<h3>wifi-safety.html</h3><pre>
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
    &lt;head&gt;
        &lt;meta charset="utf-8"&gt;
        &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
        &lt;title&gt;Using Public Wi-Fi Safely&lt;/title&gt;
        &lt;link rel="stylesheet" href="static/css/style.css"&gt;
    &lt;/head&gt;
    &lt;body&gt;
        &lt;div class="webpage"&gt;
            &lt;!-- navigation --&gt;
            &lt;nav class="navbar"&gt;
                &lt;a class="logo" href="main.html"&gt;&lt;img alt="Australian Silver Support" src="static/images/logo.png"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item home-link " href="main.html"&gt;Home&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item learn-link active" href="learn.html"&gt;Learn&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item glossary-link " href="glossary.html"&gt;Glossary&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item game-link " href="escape-the-scam.html"&gt;Escape the Scam&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;a class="nav-item about-link " href="about.html"&gt;About Us&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;button aria-label="Read the main page content aloud" class="listen-button" id="listenButton" type="button"&gt;ðŸ”Š Listen&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/nav&gt;
            &lt;main class="main figma-page interactive-lesson lesson-wifi" id="main"&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-label"&gt;LESSON 3 â€¢ READ â†’ 3 QUESTIONS â†’ ESCAPE THE SCAM&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;h1 class="fp-title"&gt;Using Public Wi-Fi Safely&lt;/h1&gt;
                &lt;p class="fp-intro"&gt;Public Wi-Fi can be useful, but unfamiliar networks are not the best place for sensitive tasks.&lt;/p&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-reading-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 1 â€” READ&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;h2&gt;Safer Wi-Fi habits&lt;/h2&gt;
                    &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Avoid banking on unknown public Wi-Fi.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use mobile data for sensitive tasks when possible.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Do not automatically connect to unfamiliar networks.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Use a connection you trust for passwords or payments.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
                    &lt;div class="game-prep-note"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this matters:&lt;/strong&gt; these exact skills are used again in Escape the Scam.&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;

                &lt;section class="lesson-quiz-panel"&gt;
                    &lt;div class="quiz-panel-title"&gt;&lt;span class="step-chip"&gt;STEP 2 â€” CHECK&lt;/span&gt;&lt;h2&gt;3 Quick Questions&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Get instant feedback before you continue.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="wifi1"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;1. You need to do online banking at a cafÃ©. What is safer?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="wifi1a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi1','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;Use the free public Wi-Fi.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="wifi1b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi1','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;Use your own mobile data or wait.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="wifi1c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi1','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;Use whichever network has the strongest signal.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="wifi1Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="wifi2"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;2. What should you avoid on unknown public Wi-Fi?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="wifi2a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi2','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;Reading the news.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="wifi2b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi2','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;Sensitive logins and payments.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="wifi2c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi2','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;Checking the weather.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="wifi2Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                    &lt;article class="lesson-question" id="wifi3"&gt;
                        &lt;h3&gt;3. Which habit is safer?&lt;/h3&gt;
                        &lt;div class="lesson-answer-row"&gt;&lt;button id="wifi3a" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi3','a')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;A&lt;/span&gt;Automatically connect to every network.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="wifi3b" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi3','b')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;B&lt;/span&gt;Use trusted networks only.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;button id="wifi3c" type="button" onclick="checkLessonAnswer('wifi3','c')"&gt;&lt;span&gt;C&lt;/span&gt;Ignore the network name.&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                        &lt;p class="lesson-feedback" id="wifi3Feedback"&gt;Choose one answer.&lt;/p&gt;
                    &lt;/article&gt;
                &lt;/section&gt;

                &lt;button class="lesson-complete quiz-complete" id="lessonCompleteButton" onclick="markLessonComplete('wifi')" type="button" disabled&gt;Mark lesson complete&lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;a class="lesson-next quiz-next" href="passwords.html"&gt;Next: Passwords&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;p class="complete-message quiz-complete-message" id="completeMessage"&gt;Answer all 3 questions to unlock this button.&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/main&gt;
            &lt;!-- footer --&gt;
            &lt;footer class="footer"&gt;
                &lt;a class="help-link" href="help.html"&gt;&lt;span class="footer-icon"&gt;â˜Ž&lt;/span&gt;Need help? call 1800 123 456&lt;/a&gt;
                &lt;div class="footer-line"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;span class="support-message"&gt;We're here to support you&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span class="safe-message"&gt;&lt;span class="footer-icon"&gt;â™¥&lt;/span&gt;Stay safe, stay connected&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;/footer&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;script src="static/js/Tung.js"&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
